    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"delivering-an-accurate-timely-and-secure-payroll-service-to-new-zealand-schools\">Delivering an accurate, timely and secure payroll service to New Zealand schools.</h2>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Education Payroll is responsible for paying around 102,000 teachers and support staff in around 2,500 schools every fortnight. That\u2019s approximately $294 million each pay period and $7.7 billion each year.</strong></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>The complexity of the schools\u2019 payroll system is constantly evolving, and we work to make things as easy as possible for our customers.  <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/edpay/\" target=\"_blank\">EdPay</a> \u2012 our online portal for schools to submit payroll instructions \u2012&nbsp;is designed with and for schools.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We also provide phone advice and guidance to school administrators and principals, assess teachers\u2019 qualifications and experience to set their correct salaries, administer third-party payments and manage overpayments.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>It\u2019s the combination of people, processes and cutting-edge technology that enables us to do this well. Our agile approach enables us to be flexible and adaptable, and respond to changes in education sector payroll requirements.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"http://www.edpay.nz\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/log-in-logo-300x156.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-439\" srcset=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/log-in-logo-300x156.png 300w, https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/log-in-logo-768x399.png 768w, https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/log-in-logo-1024x531.png 1024w, https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/log-in-logo.png 2012w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n"
    },
